OL,3,AFirst human case of Shamonda virus
OL,4,Adetected in France, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe World Health Organization (WHO) and
OL,7,FEuropean Centre for Disease Prevention
OL,8,Fand Control (ECDC) said they were
OL,9,Fmonitoring the situation, with French
OL,10,Fofficials still investigating how the
OL,11,Fvirus had spread to a human.
